     "speakerId": "laith",
     "targetText": "请把这些种子埋在地里。",
     "englishReference": "Please put these seeds in the ground.",
     "arabicTranslation": "من فضلك ضعي هذه البذور في الأرض.",
     "pronunciation": "qǐng bǎ zhè xiē zhǒng zi mái zài dì lǐ.",
